      "trace": "Historical6533 fast.rs starts its native scope from context.blocking_validation; current95e replaces this with validation_observation.start_scope. Current owned native contexts select BlockingScopes, while borrowed and browser contexts select Uncaptured. In a blocking scope, current CompiledLayout still discards device.poll result, pops the scope and formats a captured wgpu error into an anyhow message. The separately available ValidationScope::finish source preserves progress failure, native failure or both.",
